    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu akwinjila ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line Elisha ŵamŵilasile mundu jumo jwa mwikuga lya ŵakulocesya, ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Mjigale libotolo ali lya mawuta ga Olifi, nipo mliŵicile cile ulendo ŵakwawula ku msinda wa Lamoti ku Giliyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Patimkayice kweleko, mkamsosesose Yehu, mwanace jwa Yehoshafati, cisukulu ca Nimishi. Patimkamsimane, mkamjigale kumtyosya pasikati pa acimjakwe, ni mkajinjile najo mkacipinda kapacisyepela mkatame ŵaŵilipe mwelemo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni mkampungulile mawuta ga olifi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pa mtwe pakwe kulosya kuti ali mwenye jwa sambano. Ni mkamsalile kuti, ‘AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " amsagwile m'mwejo kuŵa mwenye jwa Aisalaeli.’ Papopo mkakopoce citemacitema mcipindamo, nipo mkatile, mkaja kokoŵa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwakulocesyajo ŵajawile ku Lamoti ku Giliyadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "piŵajile kwika kweleko, ŵasimene asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵakweleko ali mkutenda msongano. Jwalakwe ni ŵatite, “Odi bwana, une ngwete maloŵe gakuti nasalile.” Yehu ni ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana mkwamba ŵani pasikati petu pano?” Jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jula ŵajanjile kuti, “Ŵalakwe Bwana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yehu ŵajimi ni ŵajinjile m'nyumba. Nipo jwakulocesya jula ŵamkuyiye Yehu m'nyumba muŵajinjilemo, ni ŵampungulile mawuta ga olifi pa mtwe pakwe ni ŵamsalile kuti, “AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli akuŵeceta kuti, ‘Namsagwile m'mwejo kuti mŵe mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵangu ŵa Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 19:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo une ngusosa kuti m'mwejo mjawule mkaliwulaje liŵasa lyosope lya ambuje ŵenu Ahabu, kuti une namwucisye Yesebele, ligongo lya kwawulaga ŵakulocesya ŵangu ni ŵakutumicila ŵangu ŵane wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya Ahabu pamo ni yisukulu yakwe akwenela kuwa nditu. Timbulaje jwamlume jwalijose mwiŵasa lyakwe, jwamkulungwa kapena jwamnondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liŵasa lyakwe lyosope likwenela kuwulajidwa, mpela munalitendele liŵasa lya Yelobowamu mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, mwanace jwa Nebati. Soni mpela munalitendele liŵasa lya Basha mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli mwanace jwa Ahiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo, cilu ca Yesebele ticicilidwa ni m'mbwa, ku cilambo ca Yesilele. Pangali mundu jwalijose jutaciwusika mtembo wakwe m'malembe.’ ” Ali amalisisye kuŵeceta gele maloŵego, jwakulocesyajo jwakopwece m'nyumbamo, nipo jwatisile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵawujile Yehu kwa acakulungwa acimjakwe ŵakulongolela ngondo ŵala, jemanjajo ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana kwambone? Ana mundu jwa masoka jula amsoseleje cici?” Yehu ŵajanjile kuti, “Jemanja mkum'manyilila jwele mundu jula ni yakuŵeceta yakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jemanjajo ŵakanile, ŵatite kuti, “Uweji ngatukumanyilila atusalile yaŵecete jwele mundu jula?” Papopo, Yehu ŵasalile kuti, “Mundu jula asasile kuti, AMBUJE asagwile uneji kuti njinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo acimjakwe Yehu ŵala, ŵajigele mikanjo jawo, ni ŵajitandice pacanya pa masitepe gaŵajimi Yehu. Jumo ŵagombile lipenga nipo ŵandu ŵane ŵosope ŵagumisile kuti, “Yehu ni jwali mwenye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yolamu jwa ku Isalaeli akuwulajidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵamtendele malindi Mwenye Yolamu, juŵajawile ku Yesilele, kuti akapole maŵanga gaŵawulele ku ngondo ja ku Lamoti, jiŵaliji mkumenyana ni Mwenye Hasaele jwa ku Siliya. Myoyo Yehu ŵasalile acakulungwa acimjakwe ŵa ngondo ŵala kuti, “Naga jemanja mkusosa kuti uneji njinjile ucimwene, mlolecesye kuti mundu jwalijose akakopoka mu msinda awuno wa Lamoti, kwawula kuja kwasalila ŵandu ŵa ku Yesilele ya ngani syelesi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.14+2KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.14",
              "2KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Yehu ŵakwesile ligeleta lyakwe, ni ŵajawile ku Yesilele, pakuŵa Yolamu ŵaliji ciŵela cigonele kweleko. Ahasiya, mwenye jwa ku Yuda, ŵaliji ali ayice kukoko kukunguluka ni Yolamujo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlonda juŵajimaga pa sanja jakulondela msinda wa Yesilele, ŵaliweni likuga lya ngondo lya Yehu lili mkwisa, nipo ŵagumisile kuti, “Nguliwona likuga lya ngondo!” Yolamu ŵamsalile kuti, “Mumtume mundu pa haci, akasimane nawo, nipo akawusye kuti, ana akwisa kukunguluka mwa mtendele?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamtenga jwakwela pa haci jula ŵajawile kuja kusimana nawo, ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Mwenye akusosa kupata kumanyilila naga ulendo ŵenu uli ŵa mtendele.” Yehu ŵajanjile kuti, “M'mweji ngani ja mtendele mkwete najo masengoci? Kwende citemacitema, munguye munyuma mwangu pamo ni asilikali ŵanguŵa.” Mlonda jwakwima pa sanja jula, ŵajile kumsalila Mwenye Yolamu kuti, “Mundu jwamtenga jula ajile kwika kwa ŵandu ŵala, nambo ngakuwuja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mwenye Yolamu ŵatumisye mundu jwine jwakwela pa haci, jwele juŵajile kwasimana ŵandu ŵala, ni ŵasalile kuti, “Mwenye akusosa kumanyilila naga ulendo wenu uli ŵa mtendele.” Yehu ŵajanjile kuti, “M'mweji ngani ja mtendele mkwete najo masengoci? Kwende citemacitema, munguye munyuma mwangu pamo ni asilikali ŵanguŵa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
