        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene yeleyo Mwenye Yolamu ŵatite, “Mliŵicile cile ligeleta lyangu.” Nipo Yolamu mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, pamo ni Ahasiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda, ŵakwesile jwalijose ligeleta lyakwe, ni ŵajile kusimana najo Yehu ku mgunda uŵaliji wa Naboti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yolamu ŵamwusisye Yehu kuti, “Ana mkwika kukunguluka ni uneji mwa mtendele?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana mtendele mpaka upatikane uli, pakuŵa ŵandu ali ciŵela kujipopela milungu ja cilendo ni kutenda yindu ya usaŵi, yiŵayitandite mama ŵenu Yesebele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo Yolamu ŵapitikwisye ligeleta lyakwe kutila. Ŵagumisile kumsalila Mwenye Ahasiya kuti, “M'mwe Ahasiya kwende tutile citemacitema, ŵandu ŵeleŵa atujimucile uweji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo, Yehu ŵawutile ukunje mwamacili gakwe gosope, ni ŵamsomile Yolamu ku mgongo, mpaka mpamba wajile kusoma mtima wakwe, nipo jwalakwejo ŵagwilile mwigeleta mwakwemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Yehu ŵamsalile Bidikali kapitawo jwakwe kuti, “Mwujigale mtembo ŵakwe, ni mkawuponye mu mgunda uwaliji wa Naboti ula. Ana mkujikumbucila ndaŵi jejila jitwajendaga m'mwejo ni une, pamo ni Mwenye Ahabu, baba wawo Mwenye Yolamu, mwigeleta mwakwe? Jele ndaŵi jila AMBUJE ŵamlwesile Ahabu pakumsalila kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Mpela munakuwonele kuwulajidwa kwa Naboti ni ŵanace ŵakwe liso, kusyene ngumsalila kuti une tinjimwucisya m'mwejo cindu cakusakala celeci, mu mgunda wakwe unowuno.’ Ni ligongo lyakwe sambano mwujigale mtembo wakwewo, ni mwuponye mu mgundamo, pakuya yele yiŵaŵecete AMBUJE.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 21:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwulajidwa kwa Ahasiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda, piŵayiweni yindu yiyatendekwe yila, ŵalinjile kutila mwigeleta mwakwe kwinjilila ku msinda wa Betihagani. Nambo Yehu ŵamkuyiye pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo, ni ŵalamwile kuti, “Mumsome ni mpamba nombe najo.” Asilikaliwo ŵamsomile jwalakwejo ali mwigeleta lyakwe pa mkuli wa Guli, ŵakuŵandikana ni msinda wa Ibuleyamu. Nambo ŵapelengenye ulendo ali ciwulalile mpaka ŵajile kwika ku Megido, kuŵajile kuwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nduna syakwe syawujigele mtembo ŵakwe mwigeleta, kuja nawo ku Yelusalemu, kweleko ŵawusicile m'malembe gele giŵasicile acinangolo ŵakwe, mu msinda wa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Yuda, mu caka ca 11 ca ucimwene ŵa Yolamu mwanace jwa Ahabu, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwulajidwa kwa Yesebele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵawutandite ulendo wakuja ku Yesilele. Yesebele ŵayipikene yindu yosope yiyatendekwe yila, pa ndaŵiji Yehu ŵaliji ali mkwisa ku Yesileleko, jwalakwe ŵapacile utoto meso mwakwe, ŵalucile umbo syakwe, ni ŵajimi pewindo pa nyumba ja ucimwene, ali mkulingula kumsewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu piŵaliji mkwinjila pa cipata, Yesebele ŵagumisile ali mkuŵeceta kuti, “Ana m'mweji Simuli, mundu jwakuwulaga ambuje ŵenu, ana mkwisa akuno mwa mtendele?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ŵalolite pa cimbeleta pala, ni ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana apali ŵali kumbali ja une m'nyumbamo?” Ŵandu ŵamasengo ŵa m'nyumba ja ucimwene ŵamnono, ŵakopwesye mitwe jawo pewindo, ni ŵamlolite Yehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo ŵalamwile ŵanduwo kuti, “Mumponye jwamkongwejo pasi kupitila pewindopo.” Ŵandu ŵala ŵamponyisye jwamkongwejo pasi, nipo miasi jakwe jamisicile mwipupa ni pa mahaci. Yehu ni ŵajendesye ligeleta ni mahaci gakwe pacanya pa mtembo wa jwamkongwejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe Yehu ŵajinjile m'nyumba ja ucimwene ni ŵalile yakulya ni kumwa yakumwa. Nipo ŵasalile ŵamasengo ŵa m'nyumbamo kuti, “Jawulani mkawulokote mtembo wa jwamkongwe jwamlwesece jula, mkawusice m'malembe, pakuŵa ŵaliji mwanace jwa mwenye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵandu ŵiŵakopwece m'nyumba mula, kuti akamsice m'malembe jwamkongwejo, nginawusimana mtembowo, akaŵe cikalakasa ca mtwe, sajo ni magasa basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵala ŵayice ni ŵamsalile Yehu yiŵayiweni, nipo jwalakwejo ŵatite, “Yitendekweyi, ni yindu yiŵaŵecete AMBUJE kupitila mwa jwakulocesya jwawo Eliya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti, ‘Mtembo wa Yesebele tiwucilidwa ni m'mbwa, mcilambo ca Yesilele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mawupa gakwe tigaciŵa mpela manyowa mu mgunda, nipo tipaciŵa pangali mundu jwalijose jutaciwumanyilila mtembo ŵakwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
